      <p begin="00:07.340" end="00:08.940" ttm:agent="v1">Ziggy-ziggy-zag, I'm new</p>
      <p begin="00:08.940" end="00:10.640" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I go biggie-biggie bad, it's true</p>
