      <p begin="00:14.680" end="00:16.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hold up, what? (Oh, my god)</p>
      <p begin="00:16.240" end="00:18.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You say, what? (다쳐 넌)</p>
